---
import ShopLayout from '~/layouts/ShopLayout.astro';

const commitments = [
  { title: 'Semantic structure', desc: 'Semantic HTML with a logical heading hierarchy on every page, so screen readers and assistive technology can navigate the content correctly.' },
  { title: 'Colour contrast', desc: 'Body text and interactive elements meet WCAG 2.1 AA contrast ratios in both light and dark sections of the site.' },
  { title: 'Keyboard navigation', desc: 'Every interactive element is reachable and operable by keyboard alone, with visible focus indicators throughout.' },
  { title: 'Screen reader support', desc: 'ARIA labels on icon-only controls, a skip-to-content link on every page, and meaningful alt text on images that carry information.' },
  { title: 'Reduced motion', desc: 'Animations and transitions respect the operating system\'s prefers-reduced-motion setting and are disabled when requested.' },
  { title: 'Accessible forms', desc: 'Every form label is associated with its input, required fields are marked clearly, and error messages are announced to assistive technology.' },
];
---

<ShopLayout
  title="Accessibility Statement | PURIST"
  description="PURIST's accessibility commitment: built and tested against WCAG 2.1 Level AA, with semantic structure, keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and a direct line to report barriers."
  canonical="https://www.purist.online/pages/accessibility"
>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="bg-brand-black text-white pt-20 pb-14 lg:pt-28 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 50% 0%,rgba(232,180,176,0.08) 0%,transparent 65%);"></div>
  <div class="container-x relative z-10">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border mb-6" style="border-color:rgba(232,180,176,0.3);background:rgba(232,180,176,0.07);">
        <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] font-semibold" style="color:rgba(232,180,176,0.85);">WCAG 2.1 Level AA · Minimum standard</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-display text-[2.2rem] lg:text-[3rem] leading-[1.06] tracking-[-0.025em] text-white mb-5">
        Built to be used by<br/><em class="font-medium" style="color:#E8B4B0;">everyone.</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed max-w-xl mx-auto" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);">
        Accessibility is not a checkbox we tick once. It is a standard we design and build against on every page, and a commitment we keep reviewing as the site grows.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- What we do -->
<section class="bg-white py-16 lg:py-20 border-b border-brand-gray-100">
  <div class="container-x">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-3 text-center">What we do</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl lg:text-3xl mb-10 text-balance text-center">Six commitments, on every page.</h2>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        {commitments.map((c) => (
          <div class="p-5 rounded-[16px] border border-brand-gray-100">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-brand-black mb-1.5">{c.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-brand-gray-600 leading-relaxed">{c.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- What we're working on -->
<section class="bg-brand-cream py-16 lg:py-20 border-b border-brand-gray-100">
  <div class="container-x">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Still in progress</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl lg:text-3xl mb-5 text-balance">Accessibility is a practice, not a finished state.</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-brand-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        We audit new pages against WCAG 2.1 AA before launch, but a site this size will always have edges we haven't found yet. If you hit one, we want to know about it, and we treat every report as a real bug, not feedback that sits in a backlog.
      </p>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-[16px] bg-white border border-brand-gray-100">
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          Found a barrier on this site? Email <a href="mailto:hello@purist.online" class="underline underline-offset-4 font-medium text-brand-black">hello@purist.online</a> with a description of the issue and the page where you saw it. We reply within one business day and treat accessibility reports as priority fixes, not general feedback.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Third-party content -->
<section class="bg-white py-16 lg:py-20 border-b border-brand-gray-100">
  <div class="container-x">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Third-party content</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl lg:text-3xl mb-5 text-balance">What we can and can't control.</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-brand-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        Where this site embeds content from third parties (payment processors, embedded video, social widgets), we choose providers that meet comparable accessibility standards, but we can't guarantee accessibility we don't build ourselves. If a third-party embed is blocking you from getting something done, email us and we'll find you a direct, accessible path to the same information.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="py-16 lg:py-20" style="background:#E8B4B0;">
  <div class="container-x">
    <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-brand-black mb-3 text-balance">Hit a barrier? Tell us directly.</h2>
      <p class="text-sm mb-8" style="color:rgba(10,10,10,0.65);">No form, no ticket queue. Just email and a real person reads it the same day.</p>
      <a href="mailto:hello@purist.online" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-button text-[14px] font-bold transition bg-brand-black text-white hover:opacity-90">
        Email hello@purist.online
      </a>
      <p class="text-[12px] mt-4" style="color:rgba(10,10,10,0.45);">We review this statement regularly as the site changes.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</ShopLayout>
